 "01 · Overview": "abyss/tdd/",
 "A 10–15 minute playable tech demo. The player is a xenobiologist studying the wildlife of a small underwater cove. There are no weapons: <b>progression comes from understanding creatures</b>. Each research entry needs a scan, then the observation of specific behaviours. Completed entries open deeper zones, down to a final encounter with an immense presence glimpsed in the dark.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Pillars, and how the tech serves them": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Progressive vigilance with explicit stages and telegraphed charge timings, all in data.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Every observable behaviour emits a signal (posture, light, sound) driven by data, plus debug tools to check it.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"node__icon\">◎</span>Portfolio goals": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Show believable, readable and pleasant-to-watch <b>creature AI</b>.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Show that these systems are <b>tunable by Designers without code</b>, with the Creature Tuner.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Show that I work <b>inside Unreal’s frameworks</b> (AI Perception, Behavior Trees, State Tree, EQS, Gameplay Tags, Editor Utility Widgets) instead of reinventing them.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"node__icon\">⚠</span>Constraints": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Blueprint first. C++ only if a measured performance problem requires it, always proposed and justified first.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Mid-range machine, 1K textures max. Target: 60 fps at 1080p, <b>AI budget ≤ 2 ms</b> on the game thread.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Git without LFS, small incremental pushes. Everything in English.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Art: primitives and free Fab assets only. No modelling, no complex materials.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Scope tiers": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Minimum viable": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Must ship": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Player swimming, 3D navigation, fish shoal, sea serpent predator, observation mechanic and research journal, Creature Tuner, video.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Target": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Curious creature, full encyclopedia, zone-based spawning with EQS, final abyss zone with the Abyssal Presence, behaviour nudges.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Bonus": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Day/night cycle influencing behaviours.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Version 2": "abyss/tdd/",
