 "back together": "abyss/tdd/",
 "The fish flash silver when they flee, with a “whoosh”. The tutorial: sprint into the shoal, then observe the flight.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"node__icon\">∿</span>Sea serpent<span class=\"meta\">Behavior Tree</span>": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<b>A body made of segments that follow the head’s trail.</b> The body passes exactly where the head passed, so it never cuts corners through rocks the head avoided. Only the head collides.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "Vigilance from 0 to 1: Calm, Suspicious from 0.25, Warning from 0.5, Aggressive from 0.85": "abyss/tdd/",
